    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "###Ravi’s plan\nRavi is making a page for his bake sale.\n\n- Theme: Bake sale\n- Audience: Neighbors\n- Purpose: Show what we sell\n- Look & Feel: Warm and friendly",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/48fefa516c51a17d1eb0c586cf9bbe0a-ravi_style_design_01_1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-style-1140bdb4-5473-4cbf-8727-f204c894de61"
      },
      {
        "text": "###The AI’s first try\nThe AI built a page. It shows the treats in three cards, and it’s neat and tidy.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9bf59113b89473668345c25f4d71eda3-ravi_style_design_02_1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-style-3563d220-3d8f-4b5c-b77b-134f1e17f0ca"
      },
      {
        "text": "###Ravi checks his plan\nRavi checks the page against his plan. The look doesn’t fit. His plan says warm, and the page is cool blue and gray.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/659a899fdc8b514fb783d8aba6c1b149-ravi_style_design_03_1600.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-style-af5a19a9-402a-4614-aa9c-db4746e74af0"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ravi’s page is cool blue and gray, but his plan says warm and friendly. \n\n**What advice would you give Ravi?**\n\n- A. “Ask the AI to add three more treats to the page.”\n- B. “Ask the AI to make the hero section warm yellow and brown.”\n- C. “Ask the AI to make the whole page look nicer for your neighbors.”",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c679b19f64838089f9f5f5d8d3c04ca4-blue-background-1600x900 (1).png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-style-e0ebac1e-d530-406b-8e05-b505a1f1dddb",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "The correct answer is B. Naming the hero section and the warm colors tells the AI exactly what to change. \n\n---\n\n**Tip:** When the look is off, name the section and the colors you want. “Nicer” leaves the AI guessing.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/375366e7461d7e5ac6ba8bbf040a1476-Clear prompts spark bright ideas.png",
        "key": "adaptive-less-checkpoints-plan-panel-style-f9eebca4-2e2d-4380-af9d-7d233bf9dfc5",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
